WEBVTT

00:13.040 --> 00:15.040
Dammit, more magic?!

00:15.040 --> 00:16.460
Those damn vampires!

00:16.460 --> 00:18.290
We have to murder them
before they invoke their ma-

00:24.500 --> 00:25.880
Flames, oh flames...

00:25.880 --> 00:27.330
Ice, oh ice...

00:38.880 --> 00:40.290
I have a message from the commander!

00:40.580 --> 00:43.540
The Lapelico army has already been
completely decimated!

00:43.540 --> 00:46.830
The victory of the Komari unit
is clear as day!

00:46.830 --> 00:49.040
See that, you inferior beast-folk?

00:49.790 --> 00:53.000
Guess we're having those beast-folk's blood
made into liquor for our victory party, eh?

00:53.000 --> 00:54.880
It's too early for celebration.

00:56.330 --> 00:59.330
Victory has yet to be decided.

01:00.000 --> 01:04.920
Rejoicing in a situation where the enemy
may have some sort of ace up their sleeve

01:04.920 --> 01:06.880
is quite low-class.

01:06.880 --> 01:08.460
Shame on you.

01:09.920 --> 01:14.290
This current battle is the first campaign
for us, the Mulnite Empire.

01:19.040 --> 01:21.920
We absolutely will not be beaten.

01:23.000 --> 01:25.630
Am I right, Your Excellency Terakomari?

01:27.380 --> 01:30.500
Yes, you are correct, Caostel.

01:39.580 --> 01:41.080
Listen up, everyone!

01:41.290 --> 01:44.330
I am Terakomari Gandesblood!

01:50.790 --> 01:54.250
I've been a professional shut-in
for the past three years.

01:54.540 --> 01:58.500
<b>The Vexations of a Shut-in Vampire Princess</b>

02:00.500 --> 02:06.130
<b>The Shut-in Vampire Goes Outside</b>

02:11.790 --> 02:15.130
I constantly think about
how the world is so irrational.

02:18.130 --> 02:22.580
15 years ago, I was born into
the Gandesblood clan,

02:22.580 --> 02:25.250
one of the most noble clans
in the Mulnite Empire.

02:26.000 --> 02:28.750
The Gandesblood family has passed down

02:28.750 --> 02:31.830
the title of imperial general for
the last thousand years.

02:32.670 --> 02:38.080
I tried hard to meet the expectations
of those around me...

02:39.750 --> 02:41.500
But I quickly got frustrated.

02:43.040 --> 02:46.790
I was lacking in aptitude
in every possible way.

02:47.630 --> 02:50.380
First of all, I can't use magic.

02:50.580 --> 02:53.710
Secondly, my athletic ability is non-existent.

02:54.000 --> 02:56.830
And third, I'm short.

02:57.420 --> 03:02.210
It's clear to me the reason why I am
burdened by this trifecta of misfortune.

03:02.920 --> 03:05.540
Even though I'm a vampire,
I can't drink blood.

03:06.170 --> 03:10.460
It's a necessary source of nutrition
for growth, but I just can't stand it.

03:10.460 --> 03:12.290
The smell, the sight;

03:12.290 --> 03:14.880
I hate everything about it.

03:16.210 --> 03:20.290
In a plethora of ways, my life has
only ever been full of bitter memories.

03:20.630 --> 03:23.130
Power is everything in vampire society...

03:23.130 --> 03:26.920
I swore to be a peace-loving,
righteous vampire,

03:26.920 --> 03:29.250
and decided to shut myself in.

03:39.920 --> 03:40.920
Wha?

03:43.080 --> 03:44.830
The Mulnite national emblem...

03:44.830 --> 03:45.710
Why?

03:45.710 --> 03:48.130
Lady Terakomari, good morning.

03:48.290 --> 03:51.080
Wh-who are you?!
Why are you in my room?

03:51.330 --> 03:53.330
I should have introduced myself sooner.

03:54.000 --> 03:56.040
I am Villhaze.

03:56.460 --> 03:58.750
I belong to the Mulnite Imperial Army.

03:59.000 --> 04:01.540
My rank is junior lieutenant, third division.

04:01.540 --> 04:05.670
I've taken up a new job as Lady Terakomari's
personal maid, starting today.

04:07.630 --> 04:09.080
Still...

04:10.670 --> 04:14.330
Pardon my saying so,
but this room is quite the mess.

04:16.250 --> 04:18.540
What are you here for? Is it money?

04:18.920 --> 04:20.790
Please don't be afraid.

04:21.250 --> 04:23.880
I am an ally, Lady Terakomari.

04:28.790 --> 04:30.830
Hey, Villhaze or whatever...

04:32.540 --> 04:34.750
Wait right here a sec.

04:37.130 --> 04:38.630
We have no time for that.

04:38.880 --> 04:41.790
Come with me now to the imperial court.

04:41.790 --> 04:44.210
Let me go! I have to go pee!

04:44.420 --> 04:46.580
This is no time to pee.

04:46.580 --> 04:48.630
Please listen to me.

04:48.630 --> 04:50.500
I'm going to pee myself!
Is that what you want?!

04:50.500 --> 04:52.000
Please listen to me while you pee yourself.

04:52.000 --> 04:53.540
That's pretty perverted, don't you think?!

04:53.540 --> 04:55.790
There's no time for this,
so please do as I say.

04:55.790 --> 04:58.130
No! You're gonna kidnap me!

04:58.130 --> 05:00.880
Beauty like mine only comes around
once ever hundred million years, you know!

05:01.080 --> 05:02.880
Is that something you can say about yourself?

05:04.580 --> 05:06.500
Let her go, Vill.

05:08.630 --> 05:10.290
Oh, Komari!

05:10.290 --> 05:12.170
Are you hurt?

05:13.920 --> 05:16.460
Ou...ouch. Gonna die...

05:16.670 --> 05:19.500
More importantly, Dad!
What is her deal?!

05:22.210 --> 05:26.330
This is Vill, and she'll be your
personal maid starting today.

05:26.330 --> 05:28.830
I don't need a maid.

05:28.830 --> 05:30.960
Especially one this scary...

05:30.960 --> 05:35.710
Even so, this has been decided
by the Her Majesty.

05:35.710 --> 05:37.790
The empress? What do you mean?

05:38.210 --> 05:40.540
Let me explain that to you.

05:42.130 --> 05:43.330
Lady Terakomari.

05:43.330 --> 05:45.250
Do you know of the Seven Crimson Lords?

05:45.250 --> 05:47.460
Where's this coming from?

05:47.460 --> 05:49.210
I mean, yes, I know of them.

05:49.920 --> 05:51.880
The Seven Crimson Lords...

05:51.880 --> 05:55.580
They're seven super strong,
most fearless fighters among vampires

05:55.580 --> 05:57.420
who lead the Mulnite Army.

05:57.630 --> 05:59.630
And you have become one of them,
Lady Komari.

06:01.290 --> 06:02.500
Huh?

06:02.500 --> 06:06.580
The other day, when I asked you
"How about you start working soon?"

06:06.580 --> 06:08.210
and you replied:

06:08.670 --> 06:12.040
Well, I don't mind working
if I get the throne.

06:13.960 --> 06:16.170
I was so moved!

06:16.710 --> 06:19.170
I went and reported it to
the empress the other day,

06:19.170 --> 06:21.960
and I said "Please, pass
the throne to Komari."

06:22.250 --> 06:23.710
Are you nuts?!

06:23.710 --> 06:25.750
I did my very best for you.

06:25.750 --> 06:27.920
I then emphasized to a
thoroughly pissed empress

06:27.920 --> 06:31.080
just how much of a prodigy you are
while still having a beauty

06:31.080 --> 06:34.170
that only comes around once every
hundred million years.

06:34.380 --> 06:37.790
And then, the empress said "Interesting."

06:37.790 --> 06:39.420
This is NOT interesting!

06:39.420 --> 06:41.920
Thus, the empress entered
a contract with you,

06:41.920 --> 06:45.130
and that's how you were appointed
as a Crimson Lord.

06:45.130 --> 06:48.380
Well, I have no recollection of
that contract, though.

06:48.380 --> 06:50.580
She snuck in last night.

06:50.580 --> 06:51.540
Who did?

06:51.540 --> 06:52.330
The empress.

06:52.330 --> 06:53.250
Huh?

06:53.960 --> 06:58.250
While you were sleeping, Lady Terakomari,
she kissed you, thus sealing the contract.

07:00.500 --> 07:03.540
Whaaaaaat?!

07:03.880 --> 07:07.330
Well, hello! Welcome Komari!

07:07.790 --> 07:09.460
And you are just as darling as always!

07:09.460 --> 07:11.380
We are simply overjoyed to see you!

07:11.380 --> 07:14.710
It's an honor, but... um, Your Majesty...

07:14.710 --> 07:16.460
you're a little close for comfort,
don't you think?

07:16.460 --> 07:20.750
By the way, We would like to
massage your boobs, may We?

07:22.040 --> 07:24.790
Your Majesty, please lighten up with the jokes.

07:25.500 --> 07:26.790
She will cry.

07:26.790 --> 07:28.500
It's just a joke!

07:28.750 --> 07:31.380
We are the type who takes emotions
into great consideration.

07:31.380 --> 07:33.960
Until you are in the mood for it,
We will massage your boobs.

07:34.250 --> 07:35.830
You kissed me, right?

07:39.670 --> 07:41.830
How funny!

07:41.830 --> 07:43.960
Honorifics don't suit you!

07:44.330 --> 07:48.880
From here on, you should treat Us as
a friend you have known for 10 years!

07:48.880 --> 07:52.040
I've never had a single friend before.

07:53.500 --> 07:56.670
Now then, Terakomari Gandesblood.

07:57.170 --> 07:59.830
I called on you for no other reason
than to tell you that...

08:02.960 --> 08:06.460
It's time for the segment to explain the points
of note upon becoming a Crimson Lord!

08:06.460 --> 08:08.670
Bam bam! Woo-hoo!

08:08.670 --> 08:10.290
What's up with that picture?!

08:10.500 --> 08:13.250
The Crimson Lords have one condition
under which they must operate:

08:13.250 --> 08:16.920
Once every three months, they must
go to war with another nation and win.

08:16.920 --> 08:19.250
Furthermore, once the 100th war is won,

08:19.250 --> 08:22.170
you can gain candidacy
to become the next empress.

08:22.170 --> 08:24.210
That's an impossible hurdle to clear.

08:24.210 --> 08:27.880
On the other hand, if you
continue to lose in these wars...

08:27.880 --> 08:29.040
Will I get the chop?

08:29.040 --> 08:31.460
Yes! You'll explode and
that head will definitely fly!

08:31.460 --> 08:32.790
You have got to be kidding me!

08:32.790 --> 08:34.500
Please don't crush my expectations!

08:34.500 --> 08:35.790
Don't worry.

08:35.790 --> 08:39.420
You are in charge of around 500 men
from the 7th unit of the army.

08:39.420 --> 08:41.830
However, it is teeming with those who will

08:41.830 --> 08:45.500
certainly aim to murder their superior
upon learning they are weak.

08:45.500 --> 08:47.750
Then aren't they basically my enemies?!

08:47.750 --> 08:49.750
How can I not worry?!

08:50.080 --> 08:55.580
Vampires are the type that desire
the chance to move up in the world.

08:56.290 --> 08:57.710
Komari...

08:58.080 --> 09:00.540
You're actually weak, yes?

09:06.000 --> 09:07.790
Yes, super weak!

09:07.790 --> 09:10.420
Dying is that thing where like...
it's really painful, right?!

09:10.420 --> 09:13.080
It hurts more than bashing a pinky finger
in the corner of a dresser, doesn't it?!

09:13.080 --> 09:14.500
Then you don't want to die?

09:14.500 --> 09:16.380
Of course I don't!

09:16.670 --> 09:18.830
Then it must be kept secret.

09:19.080 --> 09:20.580
No matter what happens,

09:20.580 --> 09:24.080
you must behave as the absolute strongest
while in front of your troops.

09:24.080 --> 09:27.080
The maid next to you will be
your support with that.

09:27.080 --> 09:29.290
Please consider me capable, Lady Komari.

09:29.630 --> 09:32.750
We shall make sure to fool them all.

09:33.170 --> 09:34.880
I feel nothing but anxiety...

09:36.920 --> 09:39.750
You won't try to overthrow me, right, Vill?

09:39.750 --> 09:41.330
Of course not.

09:41.330 --> 09:44.920
I love you more than anyone else
in the universe, Lady Komari.

09:44.920 --> 09:46.500
A bold-faced lie.

09:46.500 --> 09:48.420
We just met today.

09:53.170 --> 09:55.790
It suits you quite well, Lady Komari.

09:55.790 --> 09:57.500
I-I suppose it does!

09:57.500 --> 09:59.500
Well, I may not look it,
despite how I look now,

09:59.500 --> 10:01.670
beauty like mine only comes around
once ever hundred million years, you know!

10:01.670 --> 10:03.710
Anything I put on looks amazing on me.

10:03.710 --> 10:06.250
That's wonderful, you're so pretty.

10:06.580 --> 10:10.210
In that case, how about we do a fashion show
starring you when we get back?

10:10.210 --> 10:12.000
Like hell we will, that's dumb!

10:18.000 --> 10:20.000
Now, Lady Komari.

10:20.210 --> 10:23.130
The troops you will command
are waiting for you.

10:23.130 --> 10:24.670
Y-yeah...

10:29.080 --> 10:34.080
This door must seriously weigh like
a million tons or something...

10:34.080 --> 10:38.210
It can't possibly, your run-of-the-mill
vampire should be able to open it.

10:38.210 --> 10:41.170
Well, sorry for being so abnormally weak!

10:42.750 --> 10:44.540
You've got this, Lady Komari.

10:44.540 --> 10:47.290
Hey! Don't just stand there!

10:47.290 --> 10:48.750
Help me!

10:49.790 --> 10:50.670
Ah, it's ope-

10:50.670 --> 10:56.500
Die, Your Excellency!

11:03.710 --> 11:05.670
Lady Komari, are you all right?

11:05.670 --> 11:07.420
I-I-I-I-I..

11:07.420 --> 11:10.330
I'm-I'm-I'm...

11:12.920 --> 11:14.830
There, there. Good girl.

11:14.830 --> 11:16.290
Wh-what am I gonna do?

11:16.290 --> 11:19.380
They'll probably find out
that I'm incredibly weak...

11:19.380 --> 11:21.080
No need to worry.

11:21.080 --> 11:24.130
You've triumphed over an insolent rebel.

11:24.540 --> 11:26.130
Vill, is he...

11:26.330 --> 11:27.540
He is dead.

11:27.540 --> 11:28.540
He's dead?!

11:28.540 --> 11:31.000
Oh no, how did this happen?

11:31.000 --> 11:33.580
Maybe I should leave some flowers...

11:33.580 --> 11:37.630
All a moron like him needs
is spit on his corpse.

11:37.630 --> 11:39.670
More importantly, let's go.

11:39.880 --> 11:41.540
Your troops are waiting.

11:41.540 --> 11:42.920
R-right...

11:48.500 --> 11:51.170
Am I really welcoming subjugation?

11:52.250 --> 11:55.580
Can I make it out of here alive...?

12:16.210 --> 12:19.460
Your Excellency, I am convinced.

12:19.710 --> 12:22.330
To think that of all people, Yohan Helders,

12:19.710 --> 12:25.420
<b>Used to be Yohan</b>

12:22.330 --> 12:27.960
who is especially hot-blooded even among
this 7th unit, would be killed in one strike...

12:29.580 --> 12:33.960
I can handle a vampire of his caliber
with a single pinky finger!

12:33.960 --> 12:35.330
Whoa, she's joking, right?

12:35.330 --> 12:36.170
No way...

12:36.170 --> 12:37.880
This new commander's savage...

12:38.380 --> 12:40.210
By the way, as a child,

12:40.210 --> 12:44.710
Lady Komari slayed a hundred vampires
with a single pinky finger.

12:44.710 --> 12:46.830
If Lady Komari got serious,

12:46.830 --> 12:50.880
it would be possible for her to slaughter
everyone one here in five seconds.

12:50.880 --> 12:54.210
Damn you! I don't need your input here!

12:54.210 --> 12:56.830
Anyone would be able to
figure out that's a lie!

12:58.670 --> 13:00.750
Hey! Put that thumb back down!

13:00.750 --> 13:03.000
You didn't help me out here at all!

13:03.750 --> 13:08.880
Ahem, more importantly, is it all right
if I greet the whole troop now?

13:08.880 --> 13:11.000
Yes, ma'am! You may do as you please!

13:11.000 --> 13:12.630
The 7th Unit...

13:12.630 --> 13:15.750
No, Commander Komari's troop members

13:15.750 --> 13:19.420
are sincerely and impatiently waiting for
Your Excellency's greeting.

13:28.790 --> 13:30.130
Everyone!

13:30.130 --> 13:35.540
I am the new Shichiguten,
Terakomari Gandesblood!

13:35.540 --> 13:38.250
Now that I have become your commander,

13:38.250 --> 13:41.790
understand that you will
no longer live the tranquilili...

13:48.040 --> 13:51.080
Lady Komari was so nervous
she flubbed up her speech.

13:51.080 --> 13:52.920
Well? Adorable, isn't she?

13:52.920 --> 13:55.290
Just kick me while I'm down, why don'tcha?!
Back me up!

13:57.290 --> 14:01.290
Understand that you will no longer have
the tranquil life you have been living!

14:01.290 --> 14:03.670
From here on, every day will be war!

14:03.920 --> 14:05.670
The flow of blood will be endless!

14:05.670 --> 14:07.830
The carnage will be daily!

14:08.040 --> 14:12.500
But be at ease, all you need to do
is silently follow me!

14:12.500 --> 14:17.380
Never let the thought of stupid things
like overthrowing me cross your mind,

14:17.380 --> 14:23.210
and just be faithful to the sweet and mighty
Terakomari Gandesblood!

14:24.710 --> 14:26.040
I give you my word!

14:26.040 --> 14:29.250
If you follow me,
for as long as war rages on,

14:29.250 --> 14:32.920
I will allow you to enjoy
boundless daily pleasure!

14:36.080 --> 14:39.580
Our first campaign is against
the Lapelico Kingdom's army,

14:39.580 --> 14:42.420
and our first battle is with
the nobodies led by monkeys!

14:42.420 --> 14:46.540
Simply winning is not enough!
We will be known all over the world!

14:46.540 --> 14:50.290
They will know the truth that I,
Terakomari Gandesblood,

14:50.290 --> 14:54.080
am the vampire who will become
conqueror of the world!

14:55.580 --> 14:56.670
I have an urgent message!

14:56.670 --> 14:59.080
Lieutenant Bellius has killed
the enemy general!

14:59.080 --> 15:00.710
Our army has won!

15:02.750 --> 15:05.000
I mean, if I had been on the battlefield,

15:05.000 --> 15:08.210
I could've torn the enemy general
to pieces in three seconds, though.

15:08.210 --> 15:09.920
Three seconds?

15:09.920 --> 15:12.880
No, my mistake! One second, just one!

15:12.880 --> 15:15.880
I'd stomp every last one of them
in one second!

15:15.880 --> 15:17.880
Whoa!

15:17.880 --> 15:21.380
Komarin! Komarin! Komarin! Komarin!

15:21.380 --> 15:23.630
Komarin! Komarin!

15:23.630 --> 15:25.500
Well done, everyone!

15:25.500 --> 15:28.130
However, the beasts are not our only enemies!

15:28.380 --> 15:30.130
The Warblades of the Gerra Arka Republic,

15:30.130 --> 15:34.750
and the Sapphires of the Haku-Goku
Commonwealth will learn of my strength!

15:34.750 --> 15:37.580
Also, uh...

15:38.710 --> 15:40.710
The Heavenly Paradise and
The Enchanted Lands.

15:40.710 --> 15:41.580
Right!

15:41.580 --> 15:45.330
The Heavenly Paradise and The Enchanted Lands
will be thoroughly trounced!

15:45.330 --> 15:48.080
Yeah!

15:48.250 --> 15:52.330
Yes, all you have to do is
stay loyal to the all mighty me!

15:52.330 --> 15:54.960
Under all circumstances,
follow me faithfully and obediently!

15:55.170 --> 15:57.210
Do not think of overthrowing me!

15:57.210 --> 15:59.210
Never think of that!

15:59.210 --> 16:03.080
All you have to do is
believe in and protect me!

16:03.080 --> 16:05.920
Yeah!

16:07.460 --> 16:10.460
Come, let us go forth and conquer,
my dear soldiers!

16:10.460 --> 16:14.080
Over there lies the vivid,
blood-red color of glory!

16:14.500 --> 16:18.080
Komarin! Komarin! Komarin! Komarin!

16:21.500 --> 16:23.880
How did this happen?

16:23.880 --> 16:26.380
Pardon me, do you have a moment?!

16:26.750 --> 16:30.040
I'm Melka Tiano of
the Six Nations Newspaper!

16:30.040 --> 16:34.420
Lady Terakomari Gandesblood,
is it all right if I interview you?!

16:34.420 --> 16:40.170
S-sure, ask me anything, but can you
start by giving me some space?

16:40.170 --> 16:40.580
Thank you so much!

16:40.580 --> 16:41.420
Hey!
Thank you so much!<b></b>

16:41.420 --> 16:44.420
What were the circumstances that led
to you becoming a Crimson Lord?!

16:44.420 --> 16:45.920
What relationship do you have
with Her Majesty?!

16:45.920 --> 16:47.040
What kind of food do you like?!

16:47.040 --> 16:49.540
Is it true that you killed a hundred vampires
with your pinky finger?!

16:49.540 --> 16:50.670
Do you have any lovers?

16:50.670 --> 16:51.670
Who was your first kiss?

16:51.670 --> 16:53.170
Enough, get away!

16:54.420 --> 16:56.580
The strong do not speak with words!

16:56.580 --> 17:00.960
But that may cause problems for you,
so I'll tell you just a bit!

17:01.290 --> 17:05.460
What I will be doing from now on
is simply boundless domination!

17:05.460 --> 17:08.830
Namely, Terakomari Gandesblood...

17:10.290 --> 17:14.000
will annihilate all of the commanders
of the five other nations in battle,

17:14.000 --> 17:17.670
and spread the word of the might of
Mulnite over the entire world!

17:17.670 --> 17:18.920
You got that?!

17:18.920 --> 17:20.960
W-wow...

17:22.830 --> 17:25.540
By the way, my favorite food
is omelette rice!

17:25.540 --> 17:26.580
That is all!

17:26.580 --> 17:29.040
Now THIS is a Crimson Lord.

17:29.040 --> 17:31.210
The very strongest of the vampires...

17:31.710 --> 17:33.580
Thank you, gods...

17:33.960 --> 17:37.460
I am blessed to be born in the same
generation is Her Excellency!

17:37.460 --> 17:39.500
Hey! This way, please!

17:39.500 --> 17:40.130
Yes, very cute! Wonderful!

17:40.130 --> 17:42.250
What is the point of this?
Yes, very cute! Wonderful!<b></b>

18:01.750 --> 18:03.580
Haven't died in a long time.

18:03.580 --> 18:06.000
Sure is rough, huh...

18:08.250 --> 18:13.210
In this world, a war where you
live or die doesn't exist.

18:13.880 --> 18:18.500
Each one of the six nations in this world
possesses its own "Dark Core,"

18:18.500 --> 18:24.250
a super high grade ritual article
that produces boundless magic.

18:25.170 --> 18:28.630
As far as the influence of
the Dark Core's magic is concerned,

18:28.630 --> 18:31.170
however deep the wound,

18:31.170 --> 18:33.880
however tragic the death it was,

18:33.880 --> 18:37.540
after a certain amount of time passes,
one will completely recover.

18:38.330 --> 18:43.290
As such, the place I'm standing now
is the "Dark Core Zone."

18:43.580 --> 18:46.880
It's the special area where the Dark Cores
of the six nations overlap perfectly,

18:46.880 --> 18:51.040
and the wars among us all occur
exclusively in this area.

18:51.290 --> 18:53.580
What do you think, Lady Komari?

18:53.580 --> 18:56.420
This is the so called "entertainment war."

18:59.920 --> 19:03.630
I cannot stand how absurd this is.

19:20.130 --> 19:22.170
Good morning, Lady Komari.

19:23.080 --> 19:25.540
Y-you! Why are you here?!

19:28.290 --> 19:29.250
Ah.

19:29.250 --> 19:30.880
Why are you naked?!

19:32.210 --> 19:33.380
Ah!

19:34.170 --> 19:37.170
Get some clothes on now!

19:40.380 --> 19:43.380
Lady Komari, please have a look
at today's newspaper.

19:43.830 --> 19:46.710
See, your picture from yesterday is on it.

19:46.710 --> 19:48.500
What are you talking about?!

19:48.500 --> 19:51.130
Now is not the time for newspaper... hm?

19:55.540 --> 19:57.920
"New Shichiguten Bursts Onto the Scene,

19:57.920 --> 20:00.420
Will Make the Entire World
Into Omelette Rice"

20:00.830 --> 20:03.580
"I love omelette rice.

20:03.580 --> 20:06.790
I will murder the commanders
of the other five nations,

20:06.790 --> 20:09.290
"haphazardly dump ketchup on them,

20:09.290 --> 20:13.290
and make them look like omelette rice
with the insides scooped out."

20:15.500 --> 20:19.170
This is pure and simple fake news!

20:19.330 --> 20:21.920
It's already totally agitating
the other nations, isn't it?!

20:21.920 --> 20:26.040
Correct. According to the article,
a chimpanzee killed yesterday said:

20:26.040 --> 20:28.080
"She won't get away with this!

20:28.080 --> 20:31.210
Sooner or later we will
thoroughly disgrace you!"

20:31.210 --> 20:34.710
And, they were shamelessly making
death threats in the national paper.

20:34.830 --> 20:37.250
Nooooooo!!!!

20:38.500 --> 20:40.040
Please relax.

20:40.040 --> 20:42.580
I will protect your chastity, Lady Komari.

20:42.580 --> 20:44.750
You're the one I'm most worried about!

20:44.750 --> 20:47.380
Lady Komari, about today's plans...

20:47.670 --> 20:49.920
Aaaaah, I can't hear you!

20:49.920 --> 20:51.670
Today is my day off!

20:51.880 --> 20:54.920
If you're going to stay under the covers forever,

20:54.920 --> 20:56.920
I have some ideas of my own.

20:57.210 --> 21:00.210
Hmph, if you come even one step closer to me,

21:00.210 --> 21:01.880
I'm gonna cry so hard I hiccup!

21:02.920 --> 21:05.170
"The Strawberry Milk Formula."

21:06.670 --> 21:09.920
"I thought I wanted a love
like strawberry milk.

21:10.290 --> 21:15.500
Sweet and mild, without the thrill
that teasingly torments the tongue,

21:15.500 --> 21:20.460
eternally warm, gentle;
a love like sunshine.

21:20.670 --> 21:23.920
Stop iiiiiiit!

21:25.420 --> 21:28.790
I found it when I was rummaging
through your trash can.

21:28.790 --> 21:32.290
Nevertheless, it is still a surprise
to see a love story.

21:32.750 --> 21:35.580
Anyways, if you continue to
skip out on your duties,

21:35.580 --> 21:39.040
I will distribute this story throughout
the imperial court, are you okay with that?

21:39.040 --> 21:41.040
With the writer's name attached, of course.

21:41.040 --> 21:42.040
What?

21:42.330 --> 21:43.920
Lady Komari, are you listening?

21:46.790 --> 21:49.630
I'll do whatever you say...

21:50.290 --> 21:55.250
I'm begging you, please don't tell anyone.

22:03.880 --> 22:07.630
Do not worry, I will not be doing that.

22:08.080 --> 22:10.290
Th-thanks, Vi-

22:10.290 --> 22:11.580
Ahhh!

22:11.580 --> 22:13.130
Smells so, so good!

22:13.130 --> 22:15.630
If I'm sniffing something, I should go
for her directly and not her pillow!

22:15.630 --> 22:20.330
Ah, I want to ascend to Heaven enraptured by
this sweet scent of strawberry milk!

22:22.750 --> 22:25.330
She is the creep of the century!

22:33.420 --> 22:35.920
I'm exhausted.

22:37.920 --> 22:42.580
How long has it been since I've
talked to someone this much?

22:50.080 --> 22:53.080
Try to fight back at least a little, c'mon!

22:53.080 --> 22:54.670
Stop...

22:55.710 --> 22:59.290
I don't like it, it hurts...

23:22.830 --> 23:25.170
I will never allow it!

23:36.710 --> 23:40.380
<b>A Sudden Insurrection</b>

23:37.130 --> 23:39.130
"A Sudden Insurrection."
